WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.995
IS DISTINCT FROM is useful in cleaning updates
because it handles NULL explicitly Ordinary

00:00:07.022 --> 00:00:12.630
equality follows three-valued logic IS DISTINCT FROM
tells you whether

00:00:12.656 --> 00:00:18.591
two values are meaningfully different including
cases where one is NULL This

00:00:18.605 --> 00:00:22.539
can help avoid unnecessary updates and make
conditions more predictable
